        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Episodes/Seasons: The Ricks Must Be Crazy, Rick and Morty season 2\n- People: Dan Guterman, Dominic Polcino\n- Organizations: Adult Swim, Cartoon Network\n- Events: Original air dates, season premiere, season conclusion\n\nFacts:\n- Rick and Morty season 2 premiered in the United States on July 26, 2015 on Cartoon Network's late-night programming block, Adult Swim, with the episode \"A Rickle in Time.\"\n- The Ricks Must Be Crazy was written by Dan Guterman and directed by Dominic Polcino.\n- The Ricks Must Be Crazy first aired in the United States on Adult Swim on August 30, 2015.\n- Rick and Morty season 2 concluded on October 4, 2015 with the episode \"The Wedding Squanchers.\"",
